ter\",[191],[647],\"### Q1 (b) — Elaborate entity[\\\"athlete\\\",\\\"Sachin Tendulkar\\\",\\\"Indian cricketer\\\"]’s contribution to won and lost matches.\\n\\n**Meaning**  \\n- This analysis studies **how a player performs when the team wins vs when the team loses**  \\n- Helps identify **match-winning ability**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Contribution in Won Matches\\n- Scores **higher runs** when India wins  \\n- Many **centuries in winning matches**  \\n- Better **batting average in wins**  \\n- Plays **match-stabilizing innings**  \\n- Higher **strike rate in successful chases**  \\n- Helps team build **strong totals**\\n\\n**Approx ODI Contribution (Wins)**\\n- Average in wins: **~56+**  \\n- Centuries in wins: **30+**  \\n- Higher strike rate than losses  \\n- Many **Player of the Match awards**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Contribution in Lost Matches\\n- Average slightly **lower in losses**\\n- Fewer **centuries**\\n- Often plays **lone fighting innings**\\n- Less support from other batsmen\\n- Strike rate relatively **lower**\\n\\n**Approx ODI Contribution (Losses)**\\n- Average in losses: **~33–35**\\n- Centuries in losses: **15+**\\n- Lower team totals\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Test Match Contribution\\n- Strong contribution even in **lost Tests**\\n- Often scored **big centuries overseas**\\n- Played **long innings to save matches**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Basic Comparative Analysis\\n- Better **average in won matches**\\n- More **centuries in victories**\\n- Higher **match impact**\\n- Shows **match-winning ability**\\n- Performance improves under **team success**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Conclusion\\nSachin Tendulkar contributed **significantly more in winning matches**, with higher average and more centuries, proving his role as a **match-winning batsman for India**.\",{},{\"_135\":622,\"_142\":652,\"_32\":653,\"_145\":654,\"_147\":148,\"_150\":151,\"_152\":655,\"_154\":155},\"a8a01571-7a97-40e7-b0c7-e7877e15b50a\",[610],{\"_197\":240,\"_152\":660},1775890716.652,{\"_192\":193,\"_194\":